      "writtenOn": "2024-07-01T18:48:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The proposed set of restrictions implemented for this \"interest\" seem incomplete imo, as per go/android-api-types (e.g. `core` container is missing)\n\nWill you be adding more restrictions later? If so, can you please add a tracking bug for this?",
